{"steam_appid":1243200,"steam_name":"STUFFED","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1243200/643056/6f69901775cf25b32d5588ebce4a4ab9f7482d32/1751208790/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1703173874","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256990391/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1703173874","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/ss_cc061a7b6e8d29570aa3a15b6f5b98232c3c35d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773846265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/ss_6d928e8e241377934084ce516d62e50f50a7805e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773846265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/ss_a156f4e5b1f6241001fefc461c9852ffc976167d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773846265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/ss_8fe9bc54cb69be778ba9b3da1068aac95dfcf838.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773846265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/ss_656bf9841f13676b09f8451ad598e97a4c91e329.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773846265"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/7684f27c425fe8c2dc592098b6f393ef.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=143 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/dea3d756cc1b99e702aed2ffd6efc218.poster.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/dea3d756cc1b99e702aed2ffd6efc218.webm?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/dea3d756cc1b99e702aed2ffd6efc218.mp4?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>STUFFED is a procedurally generated, horde first-person shooter, that takes place in the dreams of a little girl. Play as a teddy bear and fight waves of nightmares as you defend your owner. Play solo or join your friends in up to 4 player online co-op.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/905717dca417b01a242dfb1f25c7a81a.poster.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/905717dca417b01a242dfb1f25c7a81a.webm?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/905717dca417b01a242dfb1f25c7a81a.mp4?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your owner's bedroom door and defeat a variety of nightmares in endless waves. Earn points from defeating nightmares and use them to unlock new map areas and weapons.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.poster.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.webm?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/e46355a64e52a722bdfacb1d8c27607b.mp4?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From a popcorn grenade to a jelly bean shotgun, find and use unique weapons made from household objects.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.poster.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.webm?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/d7d30f0a5a180a44480f7ef50f9a0d1f.mp4?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Earn XP in to unlock special player abilities each game session.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.poster.avif?t=1773846265\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.webm?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1243200/extras/8e3ff42e6b114cb5704e3c479dec0991.mp4?t=1773846265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use points to unlock new outfits and furs for your teddy bear. Mix and match outfits and furs to fully personalise them.","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Waving Bear Studio"],"publishers":["Amplified Games"],"release_date":"16 Jun, 2024"}